{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/728968-hypothetical-the-destruction-of-a-relic","id":728968,"title":"Hypothetical - The Destruction of a Relic","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-26T08:16:06-07:00","id":728968,"title":"Hypothetical - The Destruction of a Relic","content":"There have been no real rules as to the difficulty required to forge or destroy a Relic. I even know some people who say that destroying one shouldn't be possible. But for the sake of argument let's say some amazing event transpires and a Relic is destroyed. What would be the repercussions? A backlash of energy? Fatebinding issues? Just looking for other player and Storyteller thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2692-captain-morganism","name":"Captain Morganism","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2692_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T02:14:38-07:00","id":731779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Captain Morganism</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/728968-hypothetical-the-destruction-of-a-relic#post728968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There have been no real rules as to the difficulty required to forge or destroy a Relic. I even know some people who say that destroying one shouldn't be possible. But for the sake of argument let's say some amazing event transpires and a Relic is destroyed. What would be the repercussions? A backlash of energy? Fatebinding issues? Just looking for other player and Storyteller thoughts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those who say it that destroying one shouldn't be possible haven't researched enough - Arthur's Caliburn/Excalibur and Sigurd's Gram are just two quick examples one can bring up, not to mention the destruction of a relic is implied as a component of a Scion reneging one's divine parent. All of that said, obviously legendary event in the making right there no matter how one ends up at it.<br /> <br /> Both the shattering of a relic and its reforging/remaking of a relic should be pretty big events in the involved parts narrative, possibly justifying raise in Legend for the shatterer and the owner/remaker of the relic both. And yeah, fatebinding is most certainly advised, personally i would roll Relic + Legend of the Scion whose relic was destroyed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}